Do your best!

243
00:14:14,210 --> 00:14:16,670
Yeah. I'll do my best.

244
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:25,920
I guess this is what I get... 
for quitting basketball once.

245
00:14:26,250 --> 00:14:28,380
Just 5 minutes and I'm exhausted...

246
00:14:29,420 --> 00:14:31,080
Hey Manager, you're in charge of drinks.

247
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,040
SAIJO

248
00:14:31,420 --> 00:14:35,170
The water for icing injuries is in the cooler box.
So get that ready, too.

249
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,290
I'm beat...

250
00:14:56,330 --> 00:14:59,040
We managed to stop the other team
from taking a huge lead.

251
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:02,920
But I had no idea all the anxiety and pressure
would wipe me out this much...

252
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:05,830
Please Chiaki, hurry and get back!

253
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:11,080
You hanging in there?

254
00:15:11,630 --> 00:15:12,790
Madoka...?

255
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:14,170
Hey Yabuuchi.

256
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,000
What the hell are you doing out here?

257
00:15:17,210 --> 00:15:21,460
Hey! Have a little more respect!
We came all the way here to cheer you guys on!

258
00:15:21,830 --> 00:15:24,420
It's only natural for us to 
come see how things pan out,

259
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:27,040
especially after all that time
we spent helping you practice.

260
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:29,750
That's for sure. If they're gonna go out,
I hope it's with a bang!

261
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:32,920
Please stop making it sound like
they're doomed to lose this match!

262
00:15:33,290 --> 00:15:35,920
If you're just gonna be a 
nuisance, then go the hell home.

263
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:38,880
Oh? Only 2 points behind!
You guys are putting up a fight!

264
00:15:39,130 --> 00:15:41,420
Um, how about the girls' team?

265
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:43,830
We lost our game.

266
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,830
But it was soooo close!

267
00:15:45,830 --> 00:15:47,790
Seriously, you won't believe it!

268
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,920
We had it down to a 1 point 
game at the very end!

269
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:52,170
I can't concentrate with all 
this screeching going on!

270
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,170
We had a chance!

271
00:15:51,170 --> 00:15:53,170
It was totally down to the wire!

272
00:15:52,170 --> 00:15:53,960
Here. You can have this.

273
00:15:53,170 --> 00:15:55,000
We put literally everything we had into it!

274
00:15:54,170 --> 00:15:55,000
For sure!

275
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:56,920
What's this supposed to be?

276
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:59,000
Brown sugar candies for a calorie boost.

277
00:15:59,330 --> 00:16:01,540
You guys didn't prepare 
anything like this, did you?

278
00:16:01,540 --> 00:16:02,460
Oh, thank you.

279
00:16:02,630 --> 00:16:05,420
Here. You all should have some.

280
00:16:05,830 --> 00:16:07,380
Thanks grandma...

281
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,790
Too damn sweet!

282
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:11,870
You need the boost.

283
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:14,030
I hear you scored 24
points in the first half alone?

284
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:15,290
You're on fire.

285
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:20,630
You know, your face is all 
sorts of beautiful, girl.

286
00:16:20,630 --> 00:16:23,290
You should wear your hair up. 
Don't let it go to waste.

287
00:16:23,290 --> 00:16:25,750
Huh? You... you really think so?

288
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,210
What a god!

289
00:16:29,170 --> 00:16:31,830
Do you enjoy eating sweet 
candies, Shigeyoshi?

290
00:16:31,830 --> 00:16:34,210
Yeah... I, uh, love them.

291
00:16:34,500 --> 00:16:37,500
Great. Then I'll give you a bonus piece.

292
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:39,380
Here, Momoharu. You need one, too.

293
00:16:39,710 --> 00:16:41,330
Great, thanks.

294
00:16:42,750 --> 00:16:44,290
Ice Pack

295
00:16:42,830 --> 00:16:44,290
I'll give you this in return.

296
00:16:44,290 --> 00:16:45,290
Huh?

297
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:46,960
'Cuz your eyes are all puffy.

298
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,040
Oh crap! He noticed!

299
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:51,130
I knew I should've put on a pair of glasses!

300
00:16:52,290 --> 00:16:54,420
Although, you should know
I was keeping it in my underwear.

301
00:16:54,630 --> 00:16:56,380
Ugh! Then keep it to yourself!

302
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:58,170
Man, these candies are super tasty.

303
00:16:59,830 --> 00:17:01,580
He's really got sharp eyes.

304
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:05,170
Got one for you, Sora. Here.

305
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:12,290
They went in and then stopped.

306
00:17:13,460 --> 00:17:16,580
Do you... understand what that means?

307
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:49,210
We can do this! We will win!

308
00:17:49,710 --> 00:17:52,630
All that energy they have
will definitely drop off in the second half!

309
00:17:52,630 --> 00:17:54,670
When it comes to hidden reserves,
we have the advantage!

310
00:17:54,670 --> 00:17:56,500
Don't any of you dare give up!

311
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:59,460
Think back on all of the 
training that we've done!

312
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:00,380
Yes, sir!

313
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:04,080
Koji, did you notice anything we could
improve upon while you were watching?

314
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:08,670
Nope. Do you think we're struggling
'cuz our team is weak...

315
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:11,040
...or 'cuz Kuzu High is just that strong?

316
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,580
I was sure that we could 
compete on an even level,

317
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:17,600
whether we went up against 
Saijo or Shinmaruko.

318
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,960
And I'm not just being an arrogant jackass.

319
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:22,210
This is a damn good matchup.

320
00:18:22,750 --> 00:18:26,000
I think we can get our 3 years worth of fun
right from the start.

321
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,710
Very true. That's a good point.

322
00:18:29,330 --> 00:18:30,960
This is what we always wanted.

323
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:33,170
Ever since we were freshmen.

324
00:18:33,460 --> 00:18:35,790
A match? But there's only 2 of you...

325
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:39,460
We roughed it out for 2 years 
playing against middle schoolers

326
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:41,050
and training absolute novices.

327
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:46,470
We've been waiting to taste 
the thrill of a close game,

328
00:18:46,470 --> 00:18:48,310
where we have to fight for every point.

329
00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:53,080
And right now... I am 
definitely living that dream!

330
00:18:53,710 --> 00:18:55,670
Kazushi. Yukio.

331
00:18:56,170 --> 00:18:58,630
Did you think our practice 
sessions were too hardcore?

332
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,710
Huh?

333
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:01,080
Why are you asking out of the blue?

334
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:04,540
They were way too hardcore! I 
wanted to quit all the time.

335
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:07,290
But you weren't one of the noobs!

336
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:11,830
You guys are amazing to make it this far.
Thanks for hanging in there.

337
00:19:13,330 --> 00:19:16,460
Captain, you're supposed to 
save that for after the game.

338
00:19:16,670 --> 00:19:18,460
Yeah, exactly! After we win it all!

339
00:19:18,710 --> 00:19:19,920
Buzz off.

340
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,500
What a jerk!

341
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:24,790
C'mon dude, it's not like everybody
is playing for your sake.

342
00:19:25,210 --> 00:19:26,460
Yeah, I know that.

343
00:19:26,710 --> 00:19:29,210
I just... wanted to try saying it.

344
00:19:30,080 --> 00:19:31,460
Ain't that a coincidence.

345
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:36,670
I was thinking about doing 
the exact same thing.

346
00:19:37,250 --> 00:19:39,080
I'm so sorry for getting back late!

347
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,790
Hey, Nanao! What about Chiaki?

348
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,040
He's okay.

349
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:45,330
Huh?

350
00:19:45,330 --> 00:19:49,580
Anyways, I'm really sorry.
We don't have time for a proper meeting now.

351
00:19:49,580 --> 00:19:52,000
Don't worry about it. It's not 
gonna be a problem for us.

352
00:19:54,250 --> 00:19:55,960
Only 3 minutes left...

353
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:59,880
Pay attention. I need all 
of you to listen closely.

354
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,410
It's true that we were 
unable to make a comeback

355
00:20:02,410 --> 00:20:04,720
in the last 5 minutes of the first half.

356
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:07,810
However, there is no doubt
that we were in control of the game for that time.

357
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:10,990
So in order to keep our momentum strong,

358
00:20:10,990 --> 00:20:14,270
we're going all in right from 
the start of the second half.

359
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:18,250
Shigeyoshi, I want to keep you
out on the court. Is that okay?

360
00:20:18,250 --> 00:20:20,210
Yeah. Of course.

361
00:20:20,210 --> 00:20:24,330
If Kurumatani decides to make a fast break,
don't force yourself to keep up.

362
00:20:24,330 --> 00:20:27,040
Momoharu will dash at full speed
to provide support instead.

363
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:27,880
Right.

364
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:30,670
Shigeyoshi can prepare for the event
we get a second chance.

365
00:20:30,670 --> 00:20:31,460
Understood.

366
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:34,130
Hold up a sec! What about Chiaki?

367
00:20:34,130 --> 00:20:36,170
He's on the bench until 
the fourth quarter, dude.

368
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:39,170
Even if we put bro back on 
the court, he couldn't do mu-

369
00:20:39,170 --> 00:20:41,290
DEATH!

370
00:20:41,290 --> 00:20:42,170
Oh crap! Kite!

371
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:45,330
I think you boys have been screwing around
a little too much lately.

372
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:47,880
And just where the hell 
have you been, jackass?!

373
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:50,670
You better not have gone to stuff your face
with a damn popsicle again!

374
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,330
Nature called!

375
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:57,170
You can drop the scary face with me, dude.

376
00:20:59,500 --> 00:21:00,670
Miss Nao.

377
00:21:00,670 --> 00:21:01,420
Uh, yes?

378
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:05,130
I want off the bench. So, 
please put me back in.

379
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,920
To assure our victory.

380
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:11,920
And... to kindle our love.

381
00:21:12,290 --> 00:21:14,330
What the hell are you talking about, dumbass?

382
00:21:14,330 --> 00:21:15,960
You've got three fouls, remember?!

383
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:18,460
We sure as hell can't afford to let you
get ejected in the third quart-

384
00:21:18,460 --> 00:21:19,460
That's fine with me.

385
00:21:19,460 --> 00:21:20,580
Huh?!

386
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:24,210
However, I'm benching you
the instant you get a fourth foul.

387
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:27,630
And then I'm not letting you back in
until the final 3 minutes.

388
00:21:28,580 --> 00:21:31,540
I like what you said earlier. 
I'm going to borrow it.

389
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:37,210
Shinjoooooo! Fight!

390
00:21:37,210 --> 00:21:39,920
We're gonna climb our way to the top!
Don't let anything stop us!

391
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:41,500
Right!

392
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,540
Let's get out there. And assure our victory!

393
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:35,420
Ahiru no Sora
Next Time: Bonds

394
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:34,210
Next episode: "Bonds."

